## Part 4. Expert Validation Matrix — English Professionals

Instrument: Run the 104-sentence Linguistic Benchmark Dataset (53 grammatical, 51 ungrammatical) through SynTutor, then rate each output.

### 4.1 Per-sentence rubric

For each benchmark item, rate **1 = Incorrect, 2 = Mostly Incorrect, 3 = Mostly Accurate, 4 = Fully Accurate**.

| Benchmark ID | Sentence | Verdict (valid/invalid) | Tree Generation Accuracy (1–4) | XAI Explanation Correctness (1–4) | Comments |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
