      {"bad":"The children packed their bags for the trip. Each child found the my note in the lunch box. The parents waved from the gate. The driver checked the his list twice. The bus left right on time.","good":"The children packed their bags for the trip. Each child found my note in the lunch box. The parents waved from the gate. The driver checked his list twice. The bus left right on time.","explanation":"Only one central determiner is allowed: \"my note\", \"his list\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The children packed their bags for the trip.","good":"The children packed their bags for the trip."},{"bad":"Each child found the my note in the lunch box.","good":"Each child found my note in the lunch box."},{"bad":"The parents waved from the gate.","good":"The parents waved from the gate."},{"bad":"The driver checked the his list twice.","good":"The driver checked his list twice."},{"bad":"The bus left right on time.","good":"The bus left right on time."}]},
      {"bad":"The family tidied the house before the guests arrived. They cleared the our old boxes from the hall. Flowers were placed on the table. The mother arranged the her best plates. Everything was ready by noon.","good":"The family tidied the house before the guests arrived. They cleared our old boxes from the hall. Flowers were placed on the table. The mother arranged her best plates. Everything was ready by noon.","explanation":"Do not stack determiners: use \"our boxes\", \"her plates\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The family tidied the house before the guests arrived.","good":"The family tidied the house before the guests arrived."},{"bad":"They cleared the our old boxes from the hall.","good":"They cleared our old boxes from the hall."},{"bad":"Flowers were placed on the table.","good":"Flowers were placed on the table."},{"bad":"The mother arranged the her best plates.","good":"The mother arranged her best plates."},{"bad":"Everything was ready by noon.","good":"Everything was ready by noon."}]},
      {"bad":"The team prepared a surprise for the coach. They hid the their banner behind the door. The players practised a short cheer. The captain checked the his watch. The coach arrived a minute later.","good":"The team prepared a surprise for the coach. They hid their banner behind the door. The players practised a short cheer. The captain checked his watch. The coach arrived a minute later.","explanation":"Use a single determiner: \"their banner\", \"his watch\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The team prepared a surprise for the coach.","good":"The team prepared a surprise for the coach."},{"bad":"They hid the their banner behind the door.","good":"They hid their banner behind the door."},{"bad":"The players practised a short cheer.","good":"The players practised a short cheer."},{"bad":"The captain checked the his watch.","good":"The captain checked his watch."},{"bad":"The coach arrived a minute later.","good":"The coach arrived a minute later."}]},
      {"bad":"The shop displayed new goods in the window. The owner moved the this shelf to the back. She replaced it with a larger table. The assistant dusted the those jars carefully. The display looked bright and inviting.","good":"The shop displayed new goods in the window. The owner moved this shelf to the back. She replaced it with a larger table. The assistant dusted those jars carefully. The display looked bright and inviting.","explanation":"Only one determiner per noun phrase: \"this shelf\", \"those jars\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The shop displayed new goods in the window.","good":"The shop displayed new goods in the window."},{"bad":"The owner moved the this shelf to the back.","good":"The owner moved this shelf to the back."},{"bad":"She replaced it with a larger table.","good":"She replaced it with a larger table."},{"bad":"The assistant dusted the those jars carefully.","good":"The assistant dusted those jars carefully."},{"bad":"The display looked bright and inviting.","good":"The display looked bright and inviting."}]},
      {"bad":"We cleaned the attic on a rainy afternoon. We found the some old photographs in a box. They showed the town many years ago. My father kept the his favourite one on the desk. We spent the rest of the day looking through them.","good":"We cleaned the attic on a rainy afternoon. We found some old photographs in a box. They showed the town many years ago. My father kept his favourite one on the desk. We spent the rest of the day looking through them.","explanation":"Use one determiner: \"some old photographs\", \"his favourite one\".","sentences":[{"bad":"We cleaned the attic on a rainy afternoon.","good":"We cleaned the attic on a rainy afternoon."},{"bad":"We found the some old photographs in a box.","good":"We found some old photographs in a box."},{"bad":"They showed the town many years ago.","good":"They showed the town many years ago."},{"bad":"My father kept the his favourite one on the desk.","good":"My father kept his favourite one on the desk."},{"bad":"We spent the rest of the day looking through them.","good":"We spent the rest of the day looking through them."}]}
