    "4.1": [
      {"bad":"The receptionist greeted the new visitor. She gave him several informations about the tour. He read a leaflet in the waiting room. Then the guide offered a useful advice about timing. The tour started a few minutes later.","good":"The receptionist greeted the new visitor. She gave him some information about the tour. He read a leaflet in the waiting room. Then the guide offered some useful advice about timing. The tour started a few minutes later.","explanation":"\"Information\" and \"advice\" are uncountable: no plural, no \"a/an\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The receptionist greeted the new visitor.","good":"The receptionist greeted the new visitor."},{"bad":"She gave him several informations about the tour.","good":"She gave him some information about the tour."},{"bad":"He read a leaflet in the waiting room.","good":"He read a leaflet in the waiting room."},{"bad":"Then the guide offered a useful advice about timing.","good":"Then the guide offered some useful advice about timing."},{"bad":"The tour started a few minutes later.","good":"The tour started a few minutes later."}]},
