      {"bad":"The doctor checked the young patient carefully. She wrote down a few advices for the parents. Then she explained how to use the medicine. She also requested more informations about his diet. The parents thanked her and left.","good":"The doctor checked the young patient carefully. She wrote down a few pieces of advice for the parents. Then she explained how to use the medicine. She also requested more information about his diet. The parents thanked her and left.","explanation":"Uncountable nouns take \"pieces of\" and no plural -s: \"advice\", \"information\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The doctor checked the young patient carefully.","good":"The doctor checked the young patient carefully."},{"bad":"She wrote down a few advices for the parents.","good":"She wrote down a few pieces of advice for the parents."},{"bad":"Then she explained how to use the medicine.","good":"Then she explained how to use the medicine."},{"bad":"She also requested more informations about his diet.","good":"She also requested more information about his diet."},{"bad":"The parents thanked her and left.","good":"The parents thanked her and left."}]},
      {"bad":"The office upgraded its computer systems. The manager bought new softwares for every team. Technicians installed it over a weekend. They also ordered extra equipments for the lab. The systems ran smoothly on Monday.","good":"The office upgraded its computer systems. The manager bought new software for every team. Technicians installed it over a weekend. They also ordered extra equipment for the lab. The systems ran smoothly on Monday.","explanation":"\"Software\" and \"equipment\" have no plural form.","sentences":[{"bad":"The office upgraded its computer systems.","good":"The office upgraded its computer systems."},{"bad":"The manager bought new softwares for every team.","good":"The manager bought new software for every team."},{"bad":"Technicians installed it over a weekend.","good":"Technicians installed it over a weekend."},{"bad":"They also ordered extra equipments for the lab.","good":"They also ordered extra equipment for the lab."},{"bad":"The systems ran smoothly on Monday.","good":"The systems ran smoothly on Monday."}]},
      {"bad":"The travellers packed for a long journey. They took a light luggage for the flight. The airport was busy that morning. Each passenger needed a valid knowledges of the rules. The flight left on time.","good":"The travellers packed for a long journey. They took light luggage for the flight. The airport was busy that morning. Each passenger needed good knowledge of the rules. The flight left on time.","explanation":"\"Luggage\" and \"knowledge\" are uncountable.","sentences":[{"bad":"The travellers packed for a long journey.","good":"The travellers packed for a long journey."},{"bad":"They took a light luggage for the flight.","good":"They took light luggage for the flight."},{"bad":"The airport was busy that morning.","good":"The airport was busy that morning."},{"bad":"Each passenger needed a valid knowledges of the rules.","good":"Each passenger needed good knowledge of the rules."},{"bad":"The flight left on time.","good":"The flight left on time."}]}
