      {"bad":"The company planned a new training programme. They designed a ten-years plan for the staff. Managers explained each stage clearly. The programme included a two-hours workshop weekly. The first session began in March.","good":"The company planned a new training programme. They designed a ten-year plan for the staff. Managers explained each stage clearly. The programme included a two-hour workshop weekly. The first session began in March.","explanation":"A noun modifier stays singular: \"ten-year plan\", \"two-hour workshop\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The company planned a new training programme.","good":"The company planned a new training programme."},{"bad":"They designed a ten-years plan for the staff.","good":"They designed a ten-year plan for the staff."},{"bad":"Managers explained each stage clearly.","good":"Managers explained each stage clearly."},{"bad":"The programme included a two-hours workshop weekly.","good":"The programme included a two-hour workshop weekly."},{"bad":"The first session began in March.","good":"The first session began in March."}]},
      {"bad":"The council approved a new building project. They funded a five-miles road through the valley. Work was due to start in spring. It would shorten the twenty-minutes journey. Residents welcomed the news.","good":"The council approved a new building project. They funded a five-mile road through the valley. Work was due to start in spring. It would shorten the twenty-minute journey. Residents welcomed the news.","explanation":"Modifiers stay singular even with a number: \"five-mile\", \"twenty-minute\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The council approved a new building project.","good":"The council approved a new building project."},{"bad":"They funded a five-miles road through the valley.","good":"They funded a five-mile road through the valley."},{"bad":"Work was due to start in spring.","good":"Work was due to start in spring."},{"bad":"It would shorten the twenty-minutes journey.","good":"It would shorten the twenty-minute journey."},{"bad":"Residents welcomed the news.","good":"Residents welcomed the news."}]},
      {"bad":"The school opened a new sports section. They built a three-courts hall beside the field. Students could play indoors in winter. The hall also hosted a six-teams tournament. The first match drew a large crowd.","good":"The school opened a new sports section. They built a three-court hall beside the field. Students could play indoors in winter. The hall also hosted a six-team tournament. The first match drew a large crowd.","explanation":"Keep the modifier singular: \"three-court\", \"six-team\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The school opened a new sports section.","good":"The school opened a new sports section."},{"bad":"They built a three-courts hall beside the field.","good":"They built a three-court hall beside the field."},{"bad":"Students could play indoors in winter.","good":"Students could play indoors in winter."},{"bad":"The hall also hosted a six-teams tournament.","good":"The hall also hosted a six-team tournament."},{"bad":"The first match drew a large crowd.","good":"The first match drew a large crowd."}]},
      {"bad":"The company offered a special travel deal. It included a seven-days cruise for two. The cabin looked out over the sea. Guests received a four-courses dinner each evening. The trip sold out quickly.","good":"The company offered a special travel deal. It included a seven-day cruise for two. The cabin looked out over the sea. Guests received a four-course dinner each evening. The trip sold out quickly.","explanation":"Modifiers stay singular: \"seven-day cruise\", \"four-course dinner\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The company offered a special travel deal.","good":"The company offered a special travel deal."},{"bad":"It included a seven-days cruise for two.","good":"It included a seven-day cruise for two."},{"bad":"The cabin looked out over the sea.","good":"The cabin looked out over the sea."},{"bad":"Guests received a four-courses dinner each evening.","good":"Guests received a four-course dinner each evening."},{"bad":"The trip sold out quickly.","good":"The trip sold out quickly."}]},
