    "6.3": [
      {"bad":"The children came home from school. My sister very happy with her test result. She showed the paper to our parents. The soup too hot to eat straight away. So we waited a few minutes before dinner.","good":"The children came home from school. My sister is very happy with her test result. She showed the paper to our parents. The soup is too hot to eat straight away. So we waited a few minutes before dinner.","explanation":"English clauses need a verb: \"is very happy\", \"is too hot\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The children came home from school.","good":"The children came home from school."},{"bad":"My sister very happy with her test result.","good":"My sister is very happy with her test result."},{"bad":"She showed the paper to our parents.","good":"She showed the paper to our parents."},{"bad":"The soup too hot to eat straight away.","good":"The soup is too hot to eat straight away."},{"bad":"So we waited a few minutes before dinner.","good":"So we waited a few minutes before dinner."}]},
      {"bad":"The waiting room filled with patients. The doctor ready to see the next person. A nurse called the first name. The seats outside quite comfortable. Everyone was seen quickly that morning.","good":"The waiting room filled with patients. The doctor is ready to see the next person. A nurse called the first name. The seats outside are quite comfortable. Everyone was seen quickly that morning.","explanation":"Add the copula: \"is ready\", \"are comfortable\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The waiting room filled with patients.","good":"The waiting room filled with patients."},{"bad":"The doctor ready to see the next person.","good":"The doctor is ready to see the next person."},{"bad":"A nurse called the first name.","good":"A nurse called the first name."},{"bad":"The seats outside quite comfortable.","good":"The seats outside are quite comfortable."},{"bad":"Everyone was seen quickly that morning.","good":"Everyone was seen quickly that morning."}]},
