      {"bad":"The café was very busy. It was to crowded to sit inside. We looked for a table outside. We decided too wait a little. A table soon became free.","good":"The café was very busy. It was too crowded to sit inside. We looked for a table outside. We decided to wait a little. A table soon became free.","explanation":"\"Too crowded\" (excessive) and \"to wait\" (infinitive).","sentences":[{"bad":"The café was very busy.","good":"The café was very busy."},{"bad":"It was to crowded to sit inside.","good":"It was too crowded to sit inside."},{"bad":"We looked for a table outside.","good":"We looked for a table outside."},{"bad":"We decided too wait a little.","good":"We decided to wait a little."},{"bad":"A table soon became free.","good":"A table soon became free."}]},
