    "11.3": [
      {"bad":"My sister is very tall. She is taller then me. She plays basketball at school. We finished dinner, than we went out. It was a pleasant evening.","good":"My sister is very tall. She is taller than me. She plays basketball at school. We finished dinner, then we went out. It was a pleasant evening.","explanation":"Use \"than\" for comparisons and \"then\" for time/sequence.","sentences":[{"bad":"My sister is very tall.","good":"My sister is very tall."},{"bad":"She is taller then me.","good":"She is taller than me."},{"bad":"She plays basketball at school.","good":"She plays basketball at school."},{"bad":"We finished dinner, than we went out.","good":"We finished dinner, then we went out."},{"bad":"It was a pleasant evening.","good":"It was a pleasant evening."}]},
      {"bad":"The new phone is expensive. It costs more then the old one. The old one still works well. We compared them, than we decided. We kept the old phone.","good":"The new phone is expensive. It costs more than the old one. The old one still works well. We compared them, then we decided. We kept the old phone.","explanation":"\"More than\" for comparison; \"then\" for sequence.","sentences":[{"bad":"The new phone is expensive.","good":"The new phone is expensive."},{"bad":"It costs more then the old one.","good":"It costs more than the old one."},{"bad":"The old one still works well.","good":"The old one still works well."},{"bad":"We compared them, than we decided.","good":"We compared them, then we decided."},{"bad":"We kept the old phone.","good":"We kept the old phone."}]},
      {"bad":"The two teams are evenly matched. The home side is faster then the visitors. The visitors are stronger. They scored, than the visitors replied. The match ended in a draw.","good":"The two teams are evenly matched. The home side is faster than the visitors. The visitors are stronger. They scored, then the visitors replied. The match ended in a draw.","explanation":"Use \"than\" to compare and \"then\" for what happens next.","sentences":[{"bad":"The two teams are evenly matched.","good":"The two teams are evenly matched."},{"bad":"The home side is faster then the visitors.","good":"The home side is faster than the visitors."},{"bad":"The visitors are stronger.","good":"The visitors are stronger."},{"bad":"They scored, than the visitors replied.","good":"They scored, then the visitors replied."},{"bad":"The match ended in a draw.","good":"The match ended in a draw."}]},
      {"bad":"The recipe was simple. It was easier then I expected. I finished the meal quickly. I cleaned up, than I relaxed. It was a good evening.","good":"The recipe was simple. It was easier than I expected. I finished the meal quickly. I cleaned up, then I relaxed. It was a good evening.","explanation":"\"Easier than\" compares; \"then\" marks the next action.","sentences":[{"bad":"The recipe was simple.","good":"The recipe was simple."},{"bad":"It was easier then I expected.","good":"It was easier than I expected."},{"bad":"I finished the meal quickly.","good":"I finished the meal quickly."},{"bad":"I cleaned up, than I relaxed.","good":"I cleaned up, then I relaxed."},{"bad":"It was a good evening.","good":"It was a good evening."}]},
      {"bad":"The train was very crowded. It was busier then usual. I found a seat near the window. I read my book, than I dozed off. The journey passed quickly.","good":"The train was very crowded. It was busier than usual. I found a seat near the window. I read my book, then I dozed off. The journey passed quickly.","explanation":"Use \"than\" for comparison and \"then\" for sequence.","sentences":[{"bad":"The train was very crowded.","good":"The train was very crowded."},{"bad":"It was busier then usual.","good":"It was busier than usual."},{"bad":"I found a seat near the window.","good":"I found a seat near the window."},{"bad":"I read my book, than I dozed off.","good":"I read my book, then I dozed off."},{"bad":"The journey passed quickly.","good":"The journey passed quickly."}]}
